{"path":"thread/thread/operator=","title":"std::thread::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::thread::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/thread/operator=","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"If *this still has an associated running thread (i.e. joinable() == true), calls std::terminate(). Otherwise, assigns the state of other to *this and sets other to a default constructed state.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">thread<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> thread<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> still has an associated running thread (i.e. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">joinable<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>), calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/terminate\"><span class=\"kw787\">std::<span class=\"me2\">terminate</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. Otherwise, assigns the state of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and sets <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> to a default constructed state.\n</p><p>After this call, <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/thread/get_id\"><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">this<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>get_id<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code></a> is equal to the value of <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/thread/get_id\"><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other.<span class=\"me1\">get_id</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code></a> prior to the call, and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> no longer represents a thread of execution.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another thread object to assign to this thread object\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/thread","title":"std::thread"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::thread::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. If *this still has an associated running thread (i.e. joinable() == true), calls std::terminate()."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":77,"codeBlockCount":0}
